Z||000005||Smokey||09-01-99||08:27 PM||||A stock 5.0 mustang is only about 1 second faster than a stock 2.8 fiero in the 1/4 mile times. I see em race against each-other all the time out in town....they run pretty even for the most part, but the mustang usually pulls away sooner or later :-)<p>Smokey*Team Fiero*<br>wrap your ass in fiberglass
